## Key Preferences

- Make database migrations opt-in rather than automatic in Vercel builds. Use a custom build script (vercel-build.mjs) that conditionally runs migrations based on environment. This allows preview deployments to use fresh/disposable databases created and migrated by CI, while production requires explicit migration control and never auto-migrates during builds. (0.59 [solution])
- Store encrypted credentials in PostgreSQL using pgcrypto extension (pgp_sym_encrypt/pgp_sym_decrypt). Create user_llm_credentials table with BYTEA column for encrypted keys and TEXT column for last-four digits (for UI display without decryption). This approach keeps secrets server-side, encrypted at rest, without needing separate key management infrastructure. (0.57 [solution])

